WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:10.010
Don't stare at me, don't capture me! {mitsumenaide...}

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.320
Ah, it's so moving!

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:14.430
I'm a butterfly that's lost her way! {mayoikonda...}

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:13.090
It's like my heart is melting!

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:15.160
Ami-chan!

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.940
Jeez.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:29.680
Embryo-san?

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:36.350
I guess I won't find the Embryo tonight either.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:39.060
The Embryo?

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.610
Oh, it's just the moon?

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:45.350
It must be playing tricks on me.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:58.140
Episode 50
We Actually Found It!? The Embryo!

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.590
What's all this?

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:07.020
Sanjo-kun sent them to us.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.650
They're all the data files on the Embryo.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:10.800
Kairi sent these?

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.020
That's just like him.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:15.060
Even if he's far away, he's still a Guardian, isn't he?

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.090
But...

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.350
Yeah.

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:20.590
Reading all of this is a little...

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:23.650
Fools! We've no time to dilly-dally!

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:27.900
We must find clues about the Embryo at all costs!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.430
Speaking of which, I saw it last-

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:32.600
Me, me!

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:34.000
You see, actually...

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.040
I have the Embryo in here!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:37.790
Yeah?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:38.390
Say what?

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.990
Let me see it! Let me see the Embryo!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.060
Hurry and open it!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:42.890
Wait, wait!

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:47.480
This is definitely something that I, as King, should open!

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.320
Go right ahead.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:03.380
I made it during Art class.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.810
He totally fell for it-dechu.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:06.940
Lame.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:08.420
Th-That's cute.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.630
It is <i>not</i> cute!

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:11.180
Take this seriously, you commoners!

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.360
We've got research to do, so start reading those files on the double.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.160
As for the rest of you, go patrol the area!

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.370
Chief Tsukumo, the preparations are complete.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:35.400
The product of applying all we've learned from past mistakes: the Embryon Mark II!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.090
This time, it will be perfect!

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:40.770
All right! Embryon Mark II, activate!

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.670
All readings are normal!

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.480
We did it, Chief!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:52.540
The robot that carries with it my youth!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.100
The reward for all my efforts!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.390
My era has finally arrived!

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.490
Starting today, we have entered the first year of Tsukumo! {i.e. like the Japanese calender system where the years are named after the current emperor}

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:03.830
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai! {I think we should leave this as Banzai to make clear the imperial Japan reference}

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:06.390
This era belongs to us!

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.420
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.370
Ikuto, wake up-nya.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.510
Look, X Eggs-nya!

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.100
Is that...

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.640
The Embryo?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:32.410
Yoru!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.850
What?

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:43.060
The X Eggs and Embryo are gone-nya!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.710
Why the heck did it explode?

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.730
Ikuto-kun!

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.890
What are you people doing here, of all places?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:06:00.140
We are making the greatest invention of the century!

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:01.240
We call it:

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.930
Embryon Mark II!

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:08.470
Our struggles thus far have all been for this great invention and-

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.470
Chief.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.920
What <i>is</i> it?

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.700
He left already.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.050
<i>What?</i>

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:20.690
Oh, Director! We're making excellent progress on the development-

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.540
Carry on, then.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:27.170
But I have one more thing to ask of you.

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.090
Yes, what is it?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.560
It's about Tsukiyomi Ikuto.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:36.730
It's those guys' fault the Embryo got away-nya.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:39.430
But we still got something out of it.

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.410
The Embryo is probably...

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:43.250
Did you figure something out?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.140
Maybe.

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:48.140
What? Tell me-nya! Tell me-nya!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:57.890
Try looking for hints about the Embryo in old fairy tales.

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:05.270
For example, it's possible the Embryo was inside the gift that was presented to Princess Kaguya. {this is a reference to the Kaguya Hime fairy tale... editor may want to keep "hime" in this case as the fairytale is best known to western audiences as "Kaguya Hime" IMO}

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.970
Princess Kaguya?

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.970
Where is that Embryo?

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:14.310
I came pretty close to it last night.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:14.920
Last night?

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:16.000
Yeah.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:20.020
I guess I won't find the Embryo tonight either.

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.600
The Embryo?

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.060
Oh, it's just the moon?

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:28.070
And that's what happened.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:30.120
That's quite the mistake.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.450
I also saw it last night-

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.270
What's going on? What're you talking about?

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:42.890
Note: "Kumo" can mean both "cloud" and "spider."

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:40.040
Kiseki mistook the moon for the Embryo when a black cloud floated in front of it.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.470
A black spider?

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.340
That's right, a black cloud.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:56.730
And so you see, he saw the Embryo inside a giant black spider!

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:58.310
Then that means-dechu...

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:05.730
That the giant black spider ate the Embryo-dechu.

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:06.810
For real?!

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:08.490
It was eaten?!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:12.340
This is something we must tell Daichi.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.840
Seriously?

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:20.350
So you see, if we can defeat the black spider, we can get the Embryo-dechu!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.760
I've got to tell Kukai this right away!

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:28.540
You see, Kukai? Do you know where this black spider is?

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:30.270
Oh, the Demon Lord's castle!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.090
The Demon Lord's castle?

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:35.900
Man, I thought the Demon Lord's castle couldn't be found,

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:38.870
but it's just that it only appears when there's a full moon!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.180
During a full moon?

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.280
Right, a night when the moon is full.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.640
Is that so?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.830
Right on!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:59.630
So, Ikuto, what did you figure out about the Embryo before?

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:02.270
Well, it's possible that...

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:12.000
Ah, I see! It comes out when a bunch of eggs are making a ruckus!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.890
That's my Ik-

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:17.100
Well, if it isn't Ikuto-kun!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:21.960
How about something to eat? A little late lunch; my homemade rice balls!

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:23.550
Dibs on the fish ones! {okaka is a type of onigiri, see http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katsuobushi}

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:25.770
I'm not hungry.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:28.600
Now now, don't be that way.

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:35.850
What? He had fish-flavored ones. {okaka is fish based, duh...}

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:38.040
It was a complete success, Director!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.640
So you attached it properly?

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.010
Yes!

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:45.520
The ultra-miniature surveillance device complete with camera and microphone!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:51.790
It no longer matters if Ikuto ends up witnessing the Embryo and fails to report it!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:55.210
We'll be able to head out immediately and capture the Embryo.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:10:00.250
By the way, Ikuto-kun is currently moving in an easterly direction.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:05.760
You're the only one who believes you're a stray cat, Ikuto.

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:11.210
In truth, you're just a domesticated cat that could never survive outside the house.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:32.690
While Amu-chan and the others were studying...

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.940
We had an emergency Guardian Character meeting!

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.810
What? Is that true?

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.470
Yeah. The giant spider is the Demon Lord.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:44.010
But the Demon Lord's castle only appears during the full moon.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:46.450
This is solid info-dechu.

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:50.480
So if we invade the castle on the night of the full moon,

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:53.410
and defeat the Demon Lord, we can get the Embryo, correct?

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.980
Right. And guess what? Tonight's the full moon.

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:59.930
Finally, the time has come!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.810
That's the Demon Lord's castle.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.280
Yeah, but why are we in these clothes?

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:12.810
They totally go against my sense of style.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.840
Why's that? I think they look good on you.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.810
I'm really into this!

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:19.100
Me, too!

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:22.720
Oh, be quiet! Stop the chatter and get a move on!

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:31.560
Defeat the monsters that appear, one at a time!

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.360
Remake Honey!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.230
Don't restore them!

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:40.580
Save our comrades who have been captured.

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.470
Why am I in this role?

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:48.520
Work through the maze in the underground caverns.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.310
I wonder what this does?

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.760
Yeah!

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.760
You little...

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.430
I'm sorry!

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.790
And finally...

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:16.930
Battle to the death with the giant spider!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:26.230
We won't let your noble sacrifice be for naught!

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:27.340
Let's go!

00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:27.890
Yeah!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.220
Guardian Character...

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:30.720
Attack!

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:50.130
The brave warrior Kiseki obtained the Embryo!

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:54.390
And then, he went on to conquer the world and become its new King!

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:56.110
Wow, that's awesome.

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:57.990
What an adventure!

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:00.640
But in the end, it was all about world domination.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:09.350
Ikuto-kun hasn't moved in a long time.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:11.390
He's probably taking a catnap or something.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:23.350
What about the Chief?

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:25.350
We should leave him be for a while.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:26.170
Right?

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:31.730
It's the night we've been waiting for: a full moon!

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.310
Sound off!

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.420
One!

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:35.110
Two.

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:36.370
I am three!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:36.940
Four!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.010
Five!

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:38.910
Six.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.310
But why am I here?

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:43.000
Good, we're all present.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:48.180
Our mission is to capture the Embryo by taking it back from the black spider Demon Lord!

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:51.190
But where is the Demon Lord's castle?

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:53.270
That's what we'll be searching for!

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:54.720
Oh, I see.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.740
Embryo Search Party,

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:58.870
move out!

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.000
Right.

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:11.740
I'm sure it's over this way!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:12.850
No, it's over that way!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.760
Let's all go this way.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:20.110
Okay!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:41.560
Oh, hello, it's been a long time!

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:47.020
And you are just as fluffy-wuffy and warm and comfy as ever.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.810
Oh dear, everyone left.

00:14:53.840 --> 00:15:00.620
We can't negate the possibility that the Embryo is in the treasure box on the Island of Oni. {this is another reference to japanese folklore}

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.740
Hey, you guys.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:06.420
Huh?

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:08.320
Hey!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.860
What's this?

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:14.770
The Demon Lord's castle?

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:17.060
Defeat the spider? The Embryo?

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.220
What does that mean?

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:21.260
Where are they?

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:23.690
No. What's going on with Kiseki?

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.140
Where did he go?

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.400
Pepe-chan isn't here either!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.140
Neither is Kusukusu.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:32.050
So the only clue is that note.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.040
I wonder if they're playing a trick on us.

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.470
Oh, Amu-chan!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.520
Where did you go, Su?

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.230
And where are Ran and the others?

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.550
Everyone went on ahead of me.

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:44.160
Huh? Where to?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.390
To the Demon Lord's castle!

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:48.930
Huh? The Demon Lord's castle?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.690
What an incredibly suspicious building!

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.580
It's definitely suspicious, but...

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.630
I wouldn't exactly call it the Demon Lord's castle.

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:01.670
It's more fun if we don't worry about the details-dechu!

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:03.150
Go, go! Get excited!

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.520
Get pumped up!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:07.010
Is everyone prepared?

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:08.560
Prepared for what?

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.470
Yoru!

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.760
What are you doing at a place like this-nya?

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:14.140
Do you really think we'd tell <i>you?</i>

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:17.180
There's a big spider over there that ate the Embryo-dechu.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:19.160
Don't tell the enemy that!

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:20.680
The Embryo?

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.350
The Embryo?!

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:23.060
Chief!

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:26.560
Look at this!

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:31.270
This is verified info-dechu! We found the Embryo-dechu!

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:34.640
That transmission is from a Guardian's Guardian Character!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.390
Report this to the Director at once!

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:37.690
Of course!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:38.940
What's the location?

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:40.960
Where is the surveillance device's signal coming from?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.090
What is it? Where?

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:46.710
It's at this laboratory.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:47.810
Huh?

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:51.680
I can sense everyone over this way!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:56.830
Let's go.

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:00.270
Amu-chan!

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:01.980
Don't "Amu-chan" me!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.430
I was worried!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:06.360
You should not have left me behind.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.380
Sorry.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.740
What in the world are you doing, Kiseki?

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:14.780
There is a giant spider inside here that swallowed the Embryo.

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:17.890
There's no way that's true.

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:22.640
Calm down-dechu!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:26.790
What's the matter?

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:28.720
What's happening?

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:29.560
Let's go.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:31.850
That's...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.700
The Demon Lord? A giant spider?

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.140
What are you talking about?

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.310
That's just a machine.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:41.020
Is it?

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.290
What is this?

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.410
I was certain I would get my hands on the Embryo tonight.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.960
We can't let our guard down!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.880
Sudden attack!

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.060
What's that?

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:01.570
It started to move!

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:03.880
I-It wasn't my fault-dechu.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:05.270
Like heck it wasn't!

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.140
Hey, what's going on?

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.820
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.750
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:17.850
So heavy...

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:21.420
Amu-chan, I sense an X Egg!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:22.320
An X Egg?

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:23.150
Yeah.

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:25.060
It's definitely coming from that machine!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:35.510
That machine is moving using the energy from an X Egg!

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:36.690
Hinamori-san.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:37.610
Right.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:38.910
Su, let's go!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:39.930
Okay.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.120
My heart:

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.480
Unlock!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:27.270
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:31.870
Holy Crown!

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:36.520
Now, Hinamori-san!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:37.590
Right.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:40.100
Sugar, honey, syrup.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:44.000
Let's melt all those bitter and sad feelings into something sweet!

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:49.600
Remake Honey!

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.470
All right!

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.120
Good job.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:08.170
What's with that? It wasn't the Embryo, after all.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:09.680
Of course it wasn't.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.390
Ikuto!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.880
So this is where you were, Yoru.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:18.420
Don't you guys know?

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:21.280
This is one of Easter's laboratories.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:22.520
It is?

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:25.110
So it's not the Demon Lord's castle?

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.280
What's that about, anyway?

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:31.210
It's the castle with the big spider that ate the Embryo.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.320
I heard about it from Pepe.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.320
And I heard about it from Ran-tan.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:36.930
I heard about it from Miki.

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:39.130
And I heard about it from Kiseki.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.810
What?!

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:45.690
I guess the story got more and more exaggerated as it passed from one person to the next.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:48.970
Chief, hurry!

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:52.570
Someone's coming.

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:53.920
Let's get out of here.

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.760
Oh, that's...

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.770
What is the meaning of this?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.940
Didn't you say you found the Embryo?

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:17.970
Well, that's...

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:20.180
Wait, Ikuto.

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:24.360
If the Embryo isn't here, then I have no business here.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:27.190
Oh, and you can have this back.

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:36.760
You may be able to do as you please for the time being,

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:42.010
but those who bear the name "Tsukiyomi" are fated to kneel before me.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:48.470
Turns out it wasn't the Embryo.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.600
I did think it was a little weird, though.

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:55.060
Don't make me go searching for you guys!

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:59.430
But I saw Embryo-san yesterday.

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:01.060
Oh, you did, did you?

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:06.830
I was positive it was the real one.

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:42.730
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.870
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:47.080
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.030
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.870
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:58.490
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.030
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.040
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:05.790
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.410
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.200
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.120
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.560
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:17.500
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.540
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.780
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:34.570
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:53.060
There've been a lot of weird disturbances lately.

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:54.110
Weird disturbances?

00:23:54.110 --> 00:23:54.350
Like what?

00:23:54.670 --> 00:23:56.020
I saw the Embryo-

00:23:56.020 --> 00:24:00.220
It's hard to explain, but it's like something really important is right in front of me.

00:24:00.220 --> 00:24:01.980
Like I said, I saw the Em-

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:03.400
Really important?

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:05.490
Something I've always, always been searching for.

00:24:05.490 --> 00:24:06.620
Could it be?

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:07.600
Might it be?

00:24:07.600 --> 00:24:08.640
It must be...

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:10.150
The Embryo!

00:24:10.150 --> 00:24:11.570
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.570 --> 00:24:12.760
Grab the Embryo!

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:14.050
Please listen to me!

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:16.760
I saw the Embryo!

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.340
Oh, you did, did you?

00:24:18.340 --> 00:24:19.520
I truly did. {aww she's so sad!}
